#* 
VigoLang Invalid Test Program - Phase 2
Author: Muhammad Ahmad
Purpose: Demonstrate syntax errors and parser error detection
*#

### This program contains intentional syntax errors

ghq[[ ]] {{
    ### ERROR 1: Missing statement terminator (@)
    qaidi_no ^x := 5
    
    ### This line will cause error because previous statement not terminated
    farmaan << "This causes error"@
    
    ### ERROR 2: Missing closing block delimiter (}})
    order_hai [[ ^x >? 0 ]] {{
        farmaan << "Greater than zero"@
    ### Missing }} here causes unmatched block error
    
    ### ERROR 3: Invalid expression - missing operator
    qaidi_no ^y := 10 20@
    
    ### ERROR 4: Missing identifier prefix (^)
    qaidi_no counter := 5@
    
    ### ERROR 5: Incorrect block delimiters (using single instead of double)
    order_hai [[ ^x =? 5 ]] {
        farmaan << "Single brace error"@
    }
    
    nro 0@
}}
